# ── MARK LIII — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
config/api_keys.json          # your Gemini API key, plus per-plugin credentials
config/certs/                 # the dashboard's TLS private key and certificate
config/whatsapp_web/          # a LINKED WhatsApp session — committing it hands
                              # somebody your WhatsApp account, not just a key
**/token*.json                # Google OAuth tokens (Gmail / Calendar plugins)
**/client_secret*.json        # Google OAuth client secrets
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db
memory/whatsapp_config.json        # WhatsApp settings + contact aliases (privacy-sensitive)
memory/whatsapp_messages.jsonl    # WhatsApp message activity log
memory/whatsapp_browser_profile/  # Persistent WhatsApp Web browser session
memory/_tmp_wa_*                  # Temporary WhatsApp upload files
memory/baileys_auth/              # Baileys Multi-Device auth credentials (TREATS LIKE PASSWORD)
memory/baileys_uploads/           # Baileys temporary upload staging
memory/baileys_*.log              # Baileys gateway process output
memory/baileys_events.jsonl       # Baileys incoming event log (PII)
memory/baileys_events.jsonl
memory/whatsapp_browser_profile/
# ── Baileys WhatsApp service ────────────────────────────────────────────────
services/whatsapp-baileys/node_modules/
services/whatsapp-baileys/package-lock.json
services/whatsapp-baileys/.pino*

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/
